  "referenceNumber": "RUS1820",
  "remarks": "\nVarvara Andreevna SKOCH is an involved person under the Russia (EU Exit) (Sanctions) Regulations 2019 on the following grounds: (1) SKOCH is acting on behalf or at the direction of a person involved in destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine, namely Andrei Vladimirovich Skoch; (2) SKOCH is associated with a person involved in destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine, namely Andrei Vladimirovich Skoch. \n",
